Package: ocular
Type: Package
Title: Spectral Indices and Sample-Free Field Boundary Delineation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Aidan",
           family = "Moller",
           email = "aidan.moller@adelaide.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for obtaining high quality spectral indices from reusable
    remote sensing pipelines. Landsat and Sentinel-2 satellite imagery are
    retrieved as scenes through the Microsoft Planetary Computer
    SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog (STAC). Data quality and temporal coverage can
    be improved before outputting as a data frame or raster, using cloud
    masking, cloud cover filtering, and reusable pipelines with highly
    customisable field boundary delineation configurations.
URL: https://github.com/AAGI-AUS/ocular
BugReports: https://github.com/AAGI-AUS/ocular/issues
